WEBVTT

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:02.165
This RV is heading into a zombie-infested town.

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:03.702
Can I bring it back in one piece?

00:00:04.195 --> 00:00:05.465
In Swarm Siege this time.

00:00:05.808 --> 00:00:07.352
I want to search for supplies

00:00:07.495 --> 00:00:08.802
while finding a route out.

00:00:10.087 --> 00:00:11.419
This time. I am leaving base defense behind.

00:00:11.912 --> 00:00:14.519
You can freely explore the abandoned town streets

00:00:14.724 --> 00:00:16.319
and choose among six infected districts.

00:00:16.799 --> 00:00:17.919
First. I drive to a garage

00:00:18.124 --> 00:00:19.557
and upgrade the roof-mounted machine gun.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.303
The upgrade costs 90 scrap

00:00:22.508 --> 00:00:23.815
and takes five seconds while parked.

00:00:24.308 --> 00:00:25.965
Then I fill the tank at a gas station

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:28.103
before heading into an infected district.

00:00:29.353 --> 00:00:30.711
I turn into the old residential district.

00:00:30.978 --> 00:00:33.223
Zombies spot the RV and start chasing it.

00:00:33.728 --> 00:00:35.836
I clear some space with the roof gun.

00:00:36.066 --> 00:00:37.736
then get out and approach the supply crate.

00:00:37.828 --> 00:00:38.748
Searching takes four seconds.

00:00:39.241 --> 00:00:40.511
I find 110 scrap.

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:42.373
plus canned food and a medkit.

00:00:43.653 --> 00:00:45.586
The trip is already paying for itself.

00:00:46.078 --> 00:00:48.198
If you enjoy driving out to scavenge.

00:00:48.428 --> 00:00:49.473
leave a like.

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:53.440
The abandoned supermarket still has an emergency vending machine.

00:00:53.945 --> 00:00:55.652
I spend 12 scrap on another can of food

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.565
in case I get hurt on foot.

00:00:58.070 --> 00:00:58.902
With supplies stocked.

00:00:59.108 --> 00:01:00.440
I head to the town square.

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:03.878
Seven zombies chase the RV here.

00:01:04.382 --> 00:01:05.765
The machine gun clears some room.

00:01:05.995 --> 00:01:07.015
then I get out to search.

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:08.477
I am unhurt.

00:01:08.682 --> 00:01:09.952
but the RV has taken damage.

00:01:10.182 --> 00:01:11.428
My next stop needs to be a garage.

00:01:12.687 --> 00:01:14.157
I detour to the north-street garage.

00:01:14.662 --> 00:01:15.719
For 40 scrap

00:01:15.887 --> 00:01:16.657
and six seconds parked.

00:01:16.799 --> 00:01:18.544
the RV is back to full durability.

00:01:19.024 --> 00:01:21.257
You do not have to clear the entire map;

00:01:21.549 --> 00:01:23.182
you can choose to leave at the northern camp.

00:01:24.453 --> 00:01:25.948
I successfully evacuate.

00:01:26.453 --> 00:01:27.448
I searched two districts.

00:01:27.628 --> 00:01:28.961
defeated 12 zombies.

00:01:29.116 --> 00:01:30.736
and brought out 314 scrap.

00:01:31.241 --> 00:01:32.698
I have not searched all six districts.

00:01:32.978 --> 00:01:35.261
Next time. I will try a full scavenging route.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:39.565
RV mode is already playable on Bilibili Toy.

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:41.290
Would you upgrade the gun first

00:01:41.582 --> 00:01:42.678
or add armor?

00:01:43.182 --> 00:01:45.328
You can also visit the Treasure Box game voting page

00:01:45.545 --> 00:01:46.802
and suggest what you want to play.
